#: src/prefs.js:62 src/prefs.js:94
msgid "None"
msgstr "Tidak ada"

#: src/prefs.js:91
msgid "Press the keys…"
msgstr "Tekan tombolnya…"

#: src/prefs.js:127
msgid "General"
msgstr "Umum"

#: src/prefs.js:130
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code"

#: src/prefs.js:131
msgid "Connect to Claude Code"
msgstr "Hubungkan ke Claude Code"

#: src/prefs.js:132
msgid ""
"When Claude is done or asks you something, you get a notification and its "
"turned off screen lights up. No account needed."
msgstr ""
"Saat Claude selesai atau menanyakan sesuatu, notifikasi muncul dan layarnya "
"yang dimatikan menyala. Tidak perlu akun."

#: src/prefs.js:137
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Terhubung"

#: src/prefs.js:137
msgid "Not connected"
msgstr "Tidak terhubung"

#: src/prefs.js:138
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Putuskan"

#: src/prefs.js:138
msgid "Connect"
msgstr "Hubungkan"

#: src/prefs.js:149
#, javascript-format
msgid "Could not change %s: %s"
msgstr "Tidak bisa mengubah %s: %s"

#: src/prefs.js:154
msgid "When Claude is done"
msgstr "Saat Claude selesai"

#: src/prefs.js:155
msgid "When Claude waits for you"
msgstr "Saat Claude menunggumu"

#: src/prefs.js:155
msgid "A permission or a question"
msgstr "Izin atau pertanyaan"

#: src/prefs.js:156
msgid "Also a notification"
msgstr "Juga notifikasi"

#: src/prefs.js:156
msgid "Click it to go to the terminal"
msgstr "Klik untuk ke terminal"

#: src/prefs.js:157
msgid "Other programs too"
msgstr "Program lain juga"

#: src/prefs.js:158
msgid ""
"Terminal bell or an app asking for attention, e.g. make ; printf \"\\a\""
msgstr ""
"Bel terminal atau aplikasi yang meminta perhatian, mis. make ; printf \"\\a\""

#: src/prefs.js:163
msgid "Sliders"
msgstr "Penggeser"

#: src/prefs.js:164
msgid ""
"Every monitor gets its own slider in Quick Settings, next to the volume "
"slider."
msgstr ""
"Setiap monitor mendapat penggeser sendiri di Pengaturan Cepat, di samping "
"penggeser volume."

#: src/prefs.js:166
msgid "Monitor menu"
msgstr "Menu monitor"

#: src/prefs.js:167
msgid "Simple (recommended)"
msgstr "Sederhana (disarankan)"

#: src/prefs.js:168
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Rinci"

#: src/prefs.js:169
msgid ""
"Simple: one slider for the value you pick. Detailed: a slider for every "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Sederhana: satu penggeser untuk nilai yang kamu pilih. Rinci: penggeser "
"untuk tiap nilai."

#: src/prefs.js:170
msgid "Left of the slider"
msgstr "Di kiri penggeser"

#: src/prefs.js:171
msgid "Brightness icon"
msgstr "Ikon kecerahan"

#: src/prefs.js:172
msgid "Monitor number (1, 2, 3…)"
msgstr "Nomor monitor (1, 2, 3…)"

#: src/prefs.js:173
msgid "Short name (LG, VS…)"
msgstr "Nama pendek (LG, VS…)"

#: src/prefs.js:175
msgid "Show the monitor name on hover"
msgstr "Tampilkan nama monitor saat disorot"

#: src/prefs.js:176
msgid "Replace GNOME’s own brightness slider"
msgstr "Ganti penggeser kecerahan bawaan GNOME"

#: src/prefs.js:177
msgid "The laptop screen then gets a row like the other monitors"
msgstr "Layar laptop lalu mendapat baris seperti monitor lain"

#: src/prefs.js:180
msgid "Night Light"
msgstr "Cahaya Malam"

#: src/prefs.js:181
msgid "Add a menu to the Night Light button"
msgstr "Tambahkan menu ke tombol Cahaya Malam"

#: src/prefs.js:182
msgid "Temperature, red screen and its strength"
msgstr "Suhu warna, layar merah dan kekuatannya"

#: src/prefs.js:188
msgid "Evening"
msgstr "Petang"

#: src/prefs.js:191 src/lib/ui.js:1287
msgid "Automatic dimming"
msgstr "Peredupan otomatis"

#: src/prefs.js:192
msgid ""
"Turn it on per monitor with the moon button next to its slider. The monitor "
"slowly gets darker and warmer in the evening and comes back in the morning."
msgstr ""
"Nyalakan per monitor dengan tombol bulan di samping penggesernya. Monitor "
"perlahan menjadi lebih gelap dan hangat di malam hari dan kembali di pagi "
"hari."

#: src/prefs.js:194 src/lib/ui.js:1305
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Mulai"

#: src/prefs.js:195
msgid "At sunset"
msgstr "Saat matahari terbenam"

#: src/prefs.js:196
msgid "At a fixed time"
msgstr "Pada waktu tetap"

#: src/prefs.js:198
msgid "Morning transition"
msgstr "Transisi pagi"

#: src/prefs.js:198
msgid "Minutes"
msgstr "Menit"

#: src/prefs.js:199 src/prefs.js:200
msgid "Morning"
msgstr "Pagi"

#: src/prefs.js:199
msgid "Minutes after sunrise"
msgstr "Menit setelah matahari terbit"

#: src/prefs.js:200
msgid "Brightness comes back at"
msgstr "Kecerahan kembali pada"

#: src/prefs.js:206
msgid "For new monitors"
msgstr "Untuk monitor baru"

#: src/prefs.js:207
msgid ""
"For the main monitor. The others take 30 minutes longer and go down to 0 %, "
"with a little extra dimming late at night. Each monitor can change these in "
"its own menu."
msgstr ""
"Untuk monitor utama. Yang lain 30 menit lebih lama dan turun ke 0 %, dengan "
"sedikit peredupan tambahan larut malam. Tiap monitor bisa mengubahnya di "
"menunya sendiri."

#: src/prefs.js:209
msgid "Minutes after sunset"
msgstr "Menit setelah matahari terbenam"

#: src/prefs.js:210
msgid "Start time"
msgstr "Waktu mulai"

#: src/prefs.js:213 src/lib/ui.js:1310
msgid "Duration"
msgstr "Durasi"

#: src/prefs.js:213
msgid "Minutes the evening dimming takes"
msgstr "Berapa menit peredupan malam berlangsung"

#: src/prefs.js:215 src/lib/ui.js:37
msgid "Night brightness"
msgstr "Kecerahan malam"

#: src/prefs.js:215
msgid "Percent"
msgstr "Persen"

#: src/prefs.js:224 src/prefs.js:227
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Lokasi"

#: src/prefs.js:225
msgid ""
"Only used to calculate sunset and sunrise. Automatic uses the location GNOME "
"keeps for Night Light, otherwise your time zone. Nothing is sent anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Hanya dipakai untuk menghitung matahari terbenam dan terbit. Otomatis "
"memakai lokasi yang disimpan GNOME untuk Cahaya Malam, atau zona waktu Anda. "
"Tidak ada yang dikirim."

#: src/prefs.js:228
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Otomatis"

#: src/prefs.js:229
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "Manual"

#: src/prefs.js:231
msgid "Latitude"
msgstr "Lintang"

#: src/prefs.js:232
msgid "Longitude"
msgstr "Bujur"

#: src/prefs.js:235
msgid "Today"
msgstr "Hari ini"

#: src/prefs.js:252
msgid "manual"
msgstr "manual"

#: src/prefs.js:253
msgid "GNOME location"
msgstr "lokasi GNOME"

#: src/prefs.js:254
#, javascript-format
msgid "time zone %s"
msgstr "zona waktu %s"

#: src/prefs.js:255
msgid "UTC offset"
msgstr "selisih UTC"

#: src/prefs.js:258
#, javascript-format
msgid "Sunset %s · sunrise %s · from %s"
msgstr "Terbenam %s · terbit %s · dari %s"

#: src/prefs.js:266
msgid "Screen off"
msgstr "Matikan layar"

#: src/prefs.js:269
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr "Tombol"

#: src/prefs.js:270
msgid "In each monitor’s menu (the moon button)."
msgstr "Di menu setiap monitor (tombol bulan)."

#: src/prefs.js:272
msgid "Place"
msgstr "Letak"

#: src/prefs.js:273
msgid "At the bottom, large"
msgstr "Di bawah, besar"

#: src/prefs.js:274
msgid "At the top, large"
msgstr "Di atas, besar"

#: src/prefs.js:275
msgid "Next to the monitor name, small"
msgstr "Di samping nama monitor, kecil"

#: src/prefs.js:277 src/lib/ui.js:339 src/lib/ui.js:1620 src/lib/ui.js:1691
msgid "Lowest light"
msgstr "Cahaya terendah"

#: src/prefs.js:278
msgid "Brightness 0 and full extra dimming; press again to go back"
msgstr "Kecerahan 0 dan peredupan ekstra penuh; tekan lagi untuk kembali"

#: src/prefs.js:279 src/prefs.js:285 src/lib/offmenu.js:48 src/lib/ui.js:340
#: src/lib/ui.js:1623
msgid "Turn off screen"
msgstr "Matikan layar"

#: src/prefs.js:280 src/lib/offmenu.js:49 src/lib/ui.js:341 src/lib/ui.js:1634
msgid "Turn off other screens"
msgstr "Matikan layar lain"

#: src/prefs.js:281
msgid "Press again to turn them back on"
msgstr "Tekan lagi untuk menyalakannya kembali"

#: src/prefs.js:286
msgid "“Turn off screen” and “Turn off other screens” in each monitor’s menu."
msgstr "“Matikan layar” dan “Matikan layar lain” di menu setiap monitor."

#: src/prefs.js:288
msgid "Light up while the mouse is on it"
msgstr "Menyala selama mouse di atasnya"

#: src/prefs.js:289
msgid ""
"A turned off screen lights up while the mouse is on it and goes dark again "
"when the mouse leaves. The same button turns it back on."
msgstr ""
"Layar yang dimatikan menyala selama mouse di atasnya dan gelap lagi saat "
"mouse pergi. Tombol yang sama menyalakannya kembali."

#: src/prefs.js:294
msgid "A turned off screen"
msgstr "Layar yang dimatikan"

#: src/prefs.js:295
msgid ""
"Clicks and typing always reach the apps on it. Its options are in the "
"monitor’s menu (the moon button) and behind the small dot."
msgstr ""
"Klik dan ketikan selalu sampai ke aplikasi di layar itu. Opsinya ada di menu "
"monitor (tombol bulan) dan di balik titik kecil."

#: src/prefs.js:297
msgid "Small dot in a corner"
msgstr "Titik kecil di sudut"

#: src/prefs.js:298
msgid "Click it for the screen’s menu; drag it to another corner"
msgstr "Klik: menu layar; seret: ke sudut lain"

#: src/prefs.js:299
msgid "Keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "Pintasan keyboard"

#: src/prefs.js:300
msgid "The menu of the screen under the mouse"
msgstr "Menu layar di bawah mouse"

#: src/prefs.js:301
msgid "“Keep lit” lasts"
msgstr "Lama “Biarkan menyala”"

#: src/prefs.js:301
msgid "Seconds"
msgstr "Detik"

#: src/prefs.js:305 src/lib/ui.js:1836 src/lib/ui.js:1911
msgid "Red screen"
msgstr "Layar merah"

#: src/prefs.js:306
msgid ""
"Switch it on in the Night Light menu. It removes all blue and green light, "
"which helps you fall asleep."
msgstr ""
"Nyalakan di menu Cahaya Malam. Menghilangkan semua cahaya biru dan hijau, "
"membantu Anda tidur."

#: src/prefs.js:308
msgid "Only while Night Light is active"
msgstr "Hanya saat Cahaya Malam aktif"

#: src/prefs.js:309
msgid "Starts and stops together with Night Light"
msgstr "Mulai dan berhenti bersama Cahaya Malam"

#: src/prefs.js:310 src/lib/ui.js:1852
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "Kekuatan"

#: src/prefs.js:324
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Lanjutan"

#: src/prefs.js:328
msgid ""
"External monitors are controlled over DDC/CI. Your user needs access to /dev/"
"i2c-* (usually the “i2c” group)."
msgstr ""
"Monitor eksternal dikendalikan lewat DDC/CI. Pengguna perlu akses ke /dev/"
"i2c-* (biasanya grup “i2c”)."

#: src/prefs.js:332
msgid "ddcutil found"
msgstr "ddcutil ditemukan"

#: src/prefs.js:332
msgid "ddcutil not found"
msgstr "ddcutil tidak ditemukan"

#: src/prefs.js:333
msgid "Install ddcutil from your distribution, then press Scan again"
msgstr "Pasang ddcutil dari distribusi Anda, lalu tekan Pindai lagi"

#: src/prefs.js:335
msgid "Scan again"
msgstr "Pindai lagi"

#: src/prefs.js:340
msgid "ddcutil program"
msgstr "Program ddcutil"

#: src/prefs.js:343
msgid "Extra arguments"
msgstr "Argumen tambahan"

#: src/prefs.js:346
msgid "Pause between writes"
msgstr "Jeda antar penulisan"

#: src/prefs.js:347
msgid "Milliseconds. Raise it if a monitor misses changes"
msgstr "Milidetik. Naikkan jika monitor melewatkan perubahan"

#: src/prefs.js:351
msgid "Debug messages"
msgstr "Pesan debug"

#: src/prefs.js:351
msgid "Written to the system journal"
msgstr "Ditulis ke jurnal sistem"

#: src/lib/cornerdot.js:61
msgid "Screen menu"
msgstr "Menu layar"

#: src/lib/displays.js:59
msgid "Monitor"
msgstr "Monitor"

#: src/lib/displays.js:415
msgid "Built-in Display"
msgstr "Layar Bawaan"

#: src/lib/displays.js:416
msgid "Built-in"
msgstr "Bawaan"

#: src/lib/displays.js:418
#, javascript-format
msgid "Monitor %d"
msgstr "Monitor %d"

#: src/lib/notify.js:115
msgid "Claude is waiting for you"
msgstr "Claude menunggumu"

#: src/lib/notify.js:115
msgid "Claude is done"
msgstr "Claude selesai"

#: src/lib/notify.js:129
msgid "Go to the terminal"
msgstr "Ke terminal"

