#, javascript-format
msgid "%d min"
msgstr "%d mnt"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:43
#, javascript-format
msgid "Keep lit · %s"
msgstr "Biarkan menyala · %s"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:44
msgid "Keep lit until I darken it"
msgstr "Biarkan menyala sampai saya gelapkan"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:45
msgid "Darken now"
msgstr "Gelapkan sekarang"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:46
msgid "Turn the screen back on"
msgstr "Nyalakan layar kembali"

#: src/lib/ui.js:36
msgid "Day brightness"
msgstr "Kecerahan siang"

#: src/lib/ui.js:38
msgid "Extra dimming"
msgstr "Peredupan ekstra"

#: src/lib/ui.js:39
msgid ""
"Darkens the picture further when the monitor is already at its lowest "
"brightness."
msgstr ""
"Menggelapkan gambar lebih jauh saat monitor sudah di kecerahan terendah."

#: src/lib/ui.js:45
msgid "Night light"
msgstr "Lampu malam"

#: src/lib/ui.js:46 src/lib/ui.js:1824
msgid ""
"Blue light in the evening holds back melatonin, the sleep hormone. A warmer "
"screen helps you fall asleep more easily."
msgstr ""
"Cahaya biru di malam hari menekan melatonin, hormon tidur. Layar yang lebih "
"hangat membantu Anda lebih mudah tertidur."

#: src/lib/ui.js:47
msgid ""
"How strong Night Light is on this monitor. ×1 = exactly GNOME’s Night Light, "
"nothing added. ×0 turns it off here, ×2 makes it twice as warm."
msgstr ""
"Seberapa kuat lampu malam di monitor ini. ×1 = persis lampu malam GNOME, "
"tanpa tambahan. ×0 mematikannya di sini, ×2 dua kali lebih hangat."

#: src/lib/ui.js:48
msgid "Red light"
msgstr "Cahaya merah"

#: src/lib/ui.js:49 src/lib/ui.js:1841
msgid ""
"Red light disturbs melatonin and your body clock the least of all colours. "
"Ideal for the last hours before bed."
msgstr ""
"Cahaya merah paling sedikit mengganggu melatonin dan jam biologis dibanding "
"warna lain. Ideal untuk jam-jam terakhir sebelum tidur."

#: src/lib/ui.js:50
msgid ""
"How strong the red screen is on this monitor. ×1 = the red screen as set in "
"the Night Light menu, nothing added. ×0 keeps this monitor normal, ×2 makes "
"it twice as red."
msgstr ""
"Seberapa kuat layar merah di monitor ini. ×1 = layar merah seperti di menu "
"lampu malam, tanpa tambahan. ×0 membiarkannya normal, ×2 dua kali lebih "
"merah."

#: src/lib/ui.js:63
#, javascript-format
msgid "%d h %d min"
msgstr "%d j %d mnt"

#: src/lib/ui.js:63
#, javascript-format
msgid "%d h"
msgstr "%d j"

#: src/lib/ui.js:284
msgid "Earlier"
msgstr "Lebih awal"

#: src/lib/ui.js:287
msgid "Later"
msgstr "Lebih lambat"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1080
msgid "Automatic dimming and more"
msgstr "Peredupan otomatis dan lainnya"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1249
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1293
msgid ""
"Slowly dims this monitor in the evening, and brings it back in the morning."
msgstr ""
"Perlahan meredupkan monitor ini di malam hari, lalu mengembalikannya di pagi "
"hari."

#: src/lib/ui.js:1294
msgid ""
"Drag the points to shape the evening; the big point also sets how long it "
"takes. + adds a button that runs by itself."
msgstr ""
"Seret titik-titiknya untuk membentuk malam; titik besar juga menentukan "
"lamanya. + menambah tombol yang berjalan sendiri."

#: src/lib/ui.js:1311
msgid "Shorter"
msgstr "Lebih singkat"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1312
msgid "Longer"
msgstr "Lebih lama"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1322
msgid "Back to normal in the morning"
msgstr "Kembali normal di pagi hari"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1326
msgid ""
"When the morning comes, lowest light and turned off screens go back to "
"normal, whether they were switched on by hand or by the graph."
msgstr ""
"Saat pagi tiba, cahaya terendah dan layar yang dimatikan kembali normal, "
"baik dinyalakan manual maupun dari grafik."

#: src/lib/ui.js:1359
msgid "Back to 100 %"
msgstr "Kembali ke 100 %"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1362 src/lib/ui.js:1364
msgid "Back to the default evening curve"
msgstr "Kembali ke kurva malam bawaan"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1380
msgid "Back to the default: ×1 and GNOME’s automatic time (sunset)"
msgstr "Kembali ke bawaan: ×1 dan waktu otomatis GNOME (matahari terbenam)"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1385
msgid "Back to ×1"
msgstr "Kembali ke ×1"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1403
msgid "Day"
msgstr "Siang"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1403
msgid "Night"
msgstr "Malam"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1403
msgid "Extra"
msgstr "Ekstra"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1404
msgid "Warmth"
msgstr "Hangat"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1404
msgid "Red"
msgstr "Merah"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1436 src/lib/ui.js:1585 src/lib/ui.js:1854
msgid "Back to the default"
msgstr "Kembali ke bawaan"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1541
msgid "While the screen is off"
msgstr "Selama layar dimatikan"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1581
msgid "Dark while off"
msgstr "Gelap saat dimatikan"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1582
msgid ""
"While the screen is off, the monitor stays at its lowest light and this much "
"black is added on top. 25 % = a little darker, 100 % = fully black."
msgstr ""
"Selama layar mati, monitor tetap di cahaya terendahnya dan sebanyak ini "
"hitam ditambahkan di atasnya. 25 % = sedikit lebih gelap, 100 % = hitam "
"penuh."

#: src/lib/ui.js:1602
#, javascript-format
msgid "Keep lit for %s"
msgstr "Biarkan menyala %s"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1603
#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"On: after the mouse leaves, the screen stays lit for %s, then goes dark. "
"Off: it goes dark as soon as the mouse leaves."
msgstr ""
"Nyala: setelah mouse pergi, layar tetap menyala %s lagi, lalu gelap. Mati: "
"langsung gelap begitu mouse pergi."

#: src/lib/ui.js:1687
#, javascript-format
msgid "Brightness %s"
msgstr "Kecerahan %s"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1689
msgid "Turned off"
msgstr "Dimatikan"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1709
#, javascript-format
msgid "Sunset %s %s %d min"
msgstr "Terbenam %s %s %d mnt"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1712
msgid "Fixed time"
msgstr "Waktu tetap"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1715
#, javascript-format
msgid "Until %s"
msgstr "Sampai %s"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1724
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Mati"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1822
msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "Suhu warna"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1825
msgid "Back to GNOME’s default"
msgstr "Kembali ke bawaan GNOME"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1919
msgid "Sunset to sunrise"
msgstr "Terbenam hingga terbit"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1941
msgid "Turns on together with Night Light"
msgstr "Menyala bersama Cahaya Malam"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1943
msgid "Starts when Night Light starts"
msgstr "Mulai saat Cahaya Malam mulai"
